%%label II. Blues: Andante con moto
%%note E flat. A twelve-bar blues for trumpet, then for alto saxophone with flute answers; a livelier middle in A flat; the blues for the whole orchestra.
X:1
T:Gershwin’s Missing Symphony
T:II. Blues: Andante con moto
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of George Gershwin
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:"Andante con moto" 1/4=72
%%score [fl ob cl sax bn] [hn tpt tbn] timp pno [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
